### 로그인 (세션 쿠키 획득)
POST {{premium-api}}/api/v1/members/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("session-cookie", response.headers.valueOf("Set-Cookie"));
%}

### 포지션 오픈 (인증 필요)
POST {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

{
  "symbol": "BTC",
  "exchange": "UPBIT",
  "quantity": 0.1,
  "entryPrice": 50000000,
  "entryFxRate": 1350.00,
  "entryPremiumRate": 3.5,
  "entryObservedAt": "2024-01-15T10:30:00Z"
}

### 열린 포지션 전체 조회 (인증 필요)
GET {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

### 포지션 단건 조회 (인증 필요)
GET {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions/1
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

### 포지션 PnL 조회 (인증 필요)
GET {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions/1/pnl
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

### 포지션 종료 (인증 필요)
POST {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions/1/close
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

### 닫힌 포지션 이력 조회 (인증 필요)
GET {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions/history
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}

### 포지션 요약 조회 (인증 필요)
GET {{premium-api}}/api/v1/positions/summary
Cookie: {{session-cookie}}
